  "title": "RESERVOIR PRESIDENT & COO RELL LAFARGUE NAMED ICMP BOARD CHAIR",
  "summary": "Today, the International Confederation of Music Publishers (ICMP), the global trade body representing the music publishing industry worldwide, announced Reservoir President & COO Rell Lafargue has been named Board Chair for the Board of Directors. Lafargue has served on the board since November 2022. The news was part of a broader ICMP announcement on newly elected board […]",
